1
00:00:00,101 --> 00:00:01,891
(Dr Hofstadter:)Logging off.

2
00:00:05,231 --> 00:00:07,271
(Amy:)Ninety-nine...

3
00:00:07,442 --> 00:00:09,322
...100.

4
00:00:09,903 --> 00:00:13,153
(Amy:)It's like a waterfall of liquid gold.

5
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,820
(Amy:)My turn.

6
00:00:21,498 --> 00:00:23,538
Don't know what the point of staying
in L.A. is.

7
00:00:23,708 --> 00:00:26,588
(Penny:)I haven't gotten a single acting job
since I moved out here.

8
00:00:26,753 --> 00:00:30,753
The closest I came was Iast month. I got
a callback for a hemorrhoid commercial.

9
00:00:30,924 --> 00:00:34,804
(Amy:)Oh, I could so see you
being the face of hemorrhoids.

10
00:00:35,303 --> 00:00:37,433
(Penny:)I know, right?

11
00:00:38,181 --> 00:00:41,101
Ugh, maybe I should just move back
to Nebraska.

12
00:00:41,434 --> 00:00:44,184
- No, I can't let you do that.
- Why not?

13
00:00:45,689 --> 00:00:48,189
(Amy:)For the first time ever,
I have a thriving social life.

14
00:00:48,358 --> 00:00:52,068
(Amy:)And no pressure,
but it kind of lives and dies with you.

15
00:00:54,656 --> 00:00:56,536
(Raj:)Hi, Amy, can I talk to Penny?

16
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:59,020
(Amy:)A guest in my trundle bed
and a boy at my door?

